hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"815","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"816","Abu Wahb"
"817","Jabir said"
"818","Sahl said"
"819","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"820","Talq ibn Habib said"
"821","Hanzala ibn Hidhaym said"
"822","Ibn 'Umar said that the Prophet"
"823","I said"
"824","Ibn 'Abdu'r-Rahman ibn Sa'id al-Makhzumi"
"825","Shabr"
"826","It is reported that al-Harith ibn Abza said"
"827","'A'isha said"
"828","Muti' said"
"829","'A'isha said that the Messenger of Allah"
"830","Umm Kulthum"
"831","Bashir ibn Nuhayk said"
"832","Part of previous hadith."
"833","Ibn 'Abbas said that Juwayriyya's name had been Barra and the Prophet"
"834","Abu Hurayra said"
"835","The Prophet"
"836","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah said"
"837","'Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"838","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"839","Anas ibn Malik said"
"840","Yusuf ibn 'Abdullah ibn Sallam said"
"841","He had a son and they wanted to name him Muhammad.""""]\nThe Prophet said"
"842","Abu Musa said"
"843","Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab reported that his grandfather went to the\nProphet"
"844","Jabir said"
"845","Ibn al-Hanafiyya was heard to say"
